# @devprojex/cli-__PLATFORM__

The self-contained DevProjex binary for `__PLATFORM__`.

npm installs this package automatically as an optional dependency of
[`devprojex`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/devprojex) on matching systems. Run or install
that package instead of this one:

```shell
npx -y devprojex --help
```

DevProjex turns a folder or repository into focused context for AI from the CLI, the
interactive Terminal Workspace, or a read-only MCP server. Documentation and source:
[github.com/Avazbek22/DevProjex](https://github.com/Avazbek22/DevProjex).
